| Video tests | None |
| Export tests | None |
| Phase / sync tests | None |
| mixx-dj-mcp pytest | Present, but `autouse` mock makes it blind to the bridge |

## Doc accuracy

`README.md` and `PRD.md` both describe features that do not exist or do not work:
the OSC control table, hardware decode, working saturation, "Pioneer .pdb", and
v0.4 export as fixed. Treat `docs/ASSESSMENT-20260726.md` as the source of truth
until those two are rewritten.
